    "name": "AWS Serverless",
    "description": "This collection provides requests for testing and managing a serverless book API hosted on AWS. It covers the complete lifecycle of book records, including listing all books, retrieving a book by ID, searching by author, creating new books, updating records fully or partially, and deleting books.\n\nAll requests use the `{{baseURL}}` variable, allowing the collection to run against different deployment environments without changing individual endpoints.",
